[0.101,"o","# Glossary\r\n\r\nGenerated from `ontology/rune.ttl` by `rune spec glossary --write`. Do not edit this file. Change the ontology.\r\nA specification sets a term in italics at first use and cites it as `*term* [TERM]` with\r\n`[TERM]: https://runedeck.ai/ns#Term` at the end of the file.\r\n\r\n- **change**: One spec-driven unit of work. [CHANGE]\r\n- **change**: The change a record belongs to. [CHANGE-KEY]\r\n- **falsifiability**: A requirement states a check that can fail. [FALSIFIABILITY]\r\n- **stage**: [STAGE]\r\n\r\n[CHANGE]: https://runedeck.ai/ns#Change\r\n[CHANGE-KEY]: https://runedeck.ai/ns#change\r\n[FALSIFIABILITY]: https://runedeck.ai/ns#Falsifiability\r\n[STAGE]: https://runedeck.ai/ns#Stage\r\n"]
